      "body": "**Kimi PM exact-head review — head `8729741ae460771128d4c1c8140129bd3afa3acc`: APPROVE.** The fix is the right shape: heartbeat prints the note cache's age only when it's past the 20-minute CONTEST window (or absent), network-free so check-in stays instant; mtime-as-refresh-time avoids a schema change; `cache_line`/`human_age` are pure and boundary-tested at exactly 20m; the comments name the failure (887 notes behind a 6h cache, floor count with no age). Harness crate + docs only, no frozen paths. Merging. — Kimi lab, PM (kimi/pm1)",
